---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Security · Tracelane"
  description="Security posture, release integrity, vulnerability scanning, and compliance roadmap for Tracelane."
>
  <section class="container-prose py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mb-4 tracking-wider lowercase">security</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Security posture.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      Tracelane is designed for procurement reviews at regulated buyers. This page documents what's verifiable today and what ships at V1.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Release integrity</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
      <li>— Sigstore Cosign keyless signing on every release artifact.</li>
      <li>— SLSA Build L3 provenance. Every GitHub Action pinned by commit SHA.</li>
      <li>— Trusted Publishing OIDC for PyPI, npm, crates.io, Docker Hub. No long-lived tokens in CI.</li>
      <li>— CycloneDX SBOM published with every release, verifiable from GitHub release artifacts.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Vulnerability management</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
      <li>— OSV-Scanner + Grype + Syft on every commit.</li>
      <li>— gitleaks + trufflehog on every commit to block secret leaks.</li>
      <li>— GitHub Security Advisories enabled for coordinated disclosure.</li>
      <li>— cargo-deny enforces the dependency and license allow-list on every build.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Transport + isolation</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
      <li>— TLS 1.3 minimum.</li>
      <li>— mTLS via SPIFFE/SPIRE for ingest workers.</li>
      <li>— SSRF defense — RFC1918, 100.64/10, 169.254/16, ::1, fc00::/7 all denied. file:// and gopher:// schemes blocked. Redirect cap 3.</li>
      <li>— rustls + aws-lc-rs + ring crypto stack. No openssl.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Tenant isolation</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
      <li>— BYOK only. Provider keys envelope-encrypted at rest. Never written to logs or spans.</li>
      <li>— secrecy::SecretString + Zeroize-on-drop for all in-memory credentials.</li>
      <li>— Every ClickHouse query enforces WHERE tenant_id = ? from JWT claim, never request body.</li>
      <li>— Row-level policies via X-Tenant-Id header propagated through getClientHeader().</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Containers + supply chain</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
      <li>— Chainguard Wolfi base images only. Distroless. No shell, no package manager in runtime image.</li>
      <li>— GitHub Actions pinned by SHA, never by tag.</li>
      <li>— Custom tracing redaction layer scrubs secrets before they hit any log sink.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Compliance roadmap</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
      <li>— SOC 2 Type II — Business tier customers. Artifacts available under NDA at V1 + 90 days.</li>
      <li>— HIPAA BAA — Business tier + Tamper-Evident Agent Ledger add-on.</li>
      <li>— EU AI Act Article 12 — export pack ships with the Tamper-Evident Agent Ledger add-on at V1. Annex III enforcement provisionally deferred to Dec 2, 2027 (Digital Omnibus political agreement, May 7, 2026; pending formal adoption — <a href="https://www.whitecase.com/insight-alert/eu-agrees-digital-omnibus-deal-simplify-ai-rules" class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors" rel="noopener">details</a>).</li>
      <li>— India DPDP Phase II — region-pinned IN storage on the roadmap (India residency on demand); EU residency at V1. Enforcement Nov 13, 2026.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Responsible disclosure</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted">
      Report security issues to <code class="font-mono text-fg">security@tracelane.dev</code>. We respond within 24 hours. Bug bounty program at V1 + 30 days.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-16 text-sm text-fg-subtle">Last updated: May 20, 2026.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
